# Generated plots. These are NOT committed to master — every plot changes daily
# (the date axis grows), so committing them here grew .git to 2.8 GB in 7 months.
# They are published to the orphan `plots` branch instead, which is force-pushed
# as a single parentless commit so plot history never accumulates. See cronjob.sh.
plots/

